# Simpler than a calendar

Read and follow [`ETHOS.md`](../../ETHOS.md).

- Prefer fewer fields; hide power options behind progressive disclosure.
- Plan when-flow default: **day + From + Until**. Multi-day only after **Runs more than one day?**
- Soft blanks are valid. Never force Until or Ends on.
- Copy: plan / day / bucket — not calendar / schedule / event chrome.
- Ship PWA and iOS together.
